    "detailed_description": "You've put points into Trapfinding and Disarming and Lockpicking, and you've maxed out your Dexterity. But what if there were no die rolls? What if the only thing separating riches from death was your skill?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this first-person action-adventure, you're a thief looting a wizard's lair. You'll need a steady hand to pick locks, good timing to dodge fire blasts, and a keen eye to spot exploding runes before they blow. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep into the rogue's shoes and see how you'd really fare. Will you be hauling out treasure, or will the wizard be hauling out your corpse?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\nMouse and keyboard<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nRandomized levels<br />\r\nJumping, dexterity, and memory puzzles<br />\r\nFour difficulty levels, each with its own high score list<br />\r\nHundreds of weird, wonderful, and zany items to loot<br />\r\nAlmost anything can be stolen. If it isn't nailed down, you can take it!",
